@startuml
!include _libcpg-theme.iuml
title One centered API Usage Graph and its mined fragment

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #495057
  RoundCorner 12
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F1F3F5
  BorderColor #495057
}

rectangle "control node\nif predicate" as CONTROL #E5DBFF
rectangle "receiver data\nIdentifier" as RECEIVER #C3FAE8
rectangle "argument 0\nString(\"cache\")" as ARGUMENT #FFF3BF
rectangle "anchor action\nlock" as ANCHOR #74C0FC
rectangle "following action\nunlock" as FOLLOWING #D3F9D8

CONTROL -[#845EF7]-> ANCHOR : Selection
RECEIVER -[#2B8A3E]-> ANCHOR : Receiver
ARGUMENT -[#E67700]-> ANCHOR : Parameter(0)
ANCHOR -[#C92A2A]-> FOLLOWING : Order

note bottom of ANCHOR
  The graph is a directed, labeled, acyclic multigraph.
  Local ApiUsageNodeId values are dense; every node also
  retains the source CodePropertyGraph NodeId.
end note

note bottom of FOLLOWING
  Across twenty centered lock graphs, nineteen contain
  the lock → unlock fragment. Exact support is <latex>19/20</latex>.
  The twentieth site receives MissingFollowingCall.
end note

legend bottom
|= Colour |= Meaning |
|<#E5DBFF>| selecting control context |
|<#C3FAE8>| method receiver data |
|<#FFF3BF>| positional argument data |
|<#74C0FC>| centered anchor API call |
|<#D3F9D8>| CFG-reachable later API call |
endlegend
@enduml
